> -What's the best weapon to have if you're a lawful priest?

Excalibur - you'll appreciate it in the Quest.  

> -What's the best alignment to be for a priest?  What about in general?

I've won with a lawful priest and not with any other priest alignment,
but I haven't tried particularly hard.  Now that I know how cool
Mjollnir is I've been more willing to play neutral characters.  I think
in general neutral is best if you want a wide variety of magic weapons
to choose from, and the chance to get and be able to use the Tourist
quest item (Platinum Yendorian Express Card) if you're cheesy enough to
wish for it without actually being a Tourist.  Chaotic characters only
have two magic weapons, I believe, and I'm not thrilled with either of
them.

> -How do I find my quest leader?

They should be an @ sitting on a throne next to a chest (well, in all
the quests I've seen) on your quest level 1.  They will send you a
telepathic message when you get to the right level.

